    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the Shooting phase of your opponent's turn or in either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit finishes choosing its targets. Pick one ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit of yours that is a target of at least one of that enemy unit's attacks. Until that phase ends, every attack aimed at your unit whose Strength is equal to or higher than your unit's Toughness gets -1 to its Wound roll.",
